        </mxCell>

        <!-- ============================================ Legend / data flows ============================================ -->
        <mxCell id="legend_box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1470" y="100" width="900" height="1130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend_title" value="DATA FLOWS  (numbers match the arrows)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0B1120;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1490" y="112" width="860" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="legend_text" value="REQUEST PLANE   browser ⇄ services&#10;  ①   Browser → nginx (HTTPS, dmpw-net)            TLS terminates at the host proxy.&#10;  ⑳   nginx → /api/* + /photos/                     fan-out to auth · identity · access · audit · device-gateway · visitor · parking · cctv.&#10;        nginx → webapp                              serves the apps/console SPA bundle.&#10;&#10;DEVICE PLANE   MQTT&#10;  ③   Devices → EMQX :1883                          MQTT/MQTTS; bootstrap gated by BOOTSTRAP_SECRET + KNOWN_APP_SIGNATURES.&#10;  ④   EMQX ⇄ device-gateway                         topic sub/pub for telemetry + commands.&#10;  ⑤   device-gateway ⇄ Valkey :6379                 sessions / rate-limit / last-seen.&#10;&#10;ACCESS DECISION PLANE   NATS JetStream&#10;  ⑥   device-gateway → NATS                         pub  dm3.devices.{tenantId}.{deviceId}.evt&#10;                                                       (tenantId carried in subject, NOT only in payload).&#10;  ⑦   NATS → access-svc                             consumer evaluates rules.&#10;  ⑧   access-svc → TimescaleDB                      INSERT  dm3_access.access_events  (hypertable).&#10;&#10;AUDIT PLANE   NATS fan-in, INSERT-only DB&#10;  ⑨   every app svc → NATS                          pub  dm3.audit.{service}  via pkg/audit.Logger  (fire &amp; forget).&#10;  ⑩   NATS → audit-svc → TimescaleDB                batch-INSERT  dm3_audit.audit_logs.&#10;                                                       UPDATE/DELETE revoked for app role.   2-yr retention; compress &gt; 30 d.&#10;&#10;VIDEO PLANE   MediaMTX&#10;  ⑪   Cameras → MediaMTX                            RTSP push :8554.&#10;  ⑫   cctv-svc → MediaMTX HTTP API :9997            provision paths; auth via MEDIAMTX_API_USER / _PASS.&#10;  ⑬   cctv-svc → NATS                               subscribe access events for clip-on-event.&#10;  ⑭   cctv-svc → MinIO                              S3 PUT clip blobs.&#10;  ⑮   Browser → nginx → MediaMTX                    live view: WebRTC/WHEP :8889 or LL-HLS :8888.&#10;                                                       Browser never reaches MediaMTX directly — nginx fronts it.&#10;&#10;STORAGE PLANE&#10;  ⑯   all app services ⇄ TimescaleDB                explicit  WHERE tenant_id = $N.&#10;                                                       No query rewriter; cross-tenant via internal/tenant.ValidateResourceAccess.&#10;  ⑰   identity-svc ⇄ MinIO                          S3 PUT/GET&#10;                                                       tenants/{tenantId}/identity/users/{userId}/{variant}{ext}&#10;                                                       served back via  nginx → identity-svc /photos/  (tenant-prefix isolation check).&#10;  ⑱   migrate → TimescaleDB                         runs once per deploy and exits 0.&#10;                                                       Every app svc  depends_on: migrate: service_completed_successfully.&#10;&#10;OPERATIONAL NOTES&#10;  •  Networks:   dm3-internal (bridge, all containers) · dmpw-net (external; ONLY nginx joins, so the host's main reverse proxy reaches us by container name).&#10;  •  Plugin-gating:   visitor · parking · cctv ship in the image but only do work for tenants whose plugin flag is enabled.&#10;  •  Healthchecks:   every app exposes /healthz; nginx waits on cctv-svc service_healthy before starting.&#10;  •  Required secrets (.env from GitLab CI vars):   DB_PASSWORD · JWT_SECRET · MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD · BOOTSTRAP_SECRET&#10;                                                       CCTV_CREDENTIAL_KEY  (must base64-decode to exactly 32 bytes — `openssl rand -base64 32`)&#10;  •  Aspirational topology (vertical apps · AI/ML · external integrations) lives in docs/architecture/system-architecture.md and the C4 diagrams." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Menlo,Monaco,monospace;spacingTop=10;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1490" y="138" width="860" height="1080" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

